{"id":"n65864-2-7","stage":0,"title":"비슷하다 · 相似","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65864-2-7-1","ko":"모양은 과자 비슷한데 이게 뭐지?","zh":"形状有点像饼干，这是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모양은","meaning":"形状","explanation":"모양：形状；-은 标记话题。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"5","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모양은","audio":"/audio/9f082920a60e242ce7d2.mp3"}},{"text":"과자","meaning":"饼干、点心","explanation":"과자：饼干、点心；这里用来比较物品的外形。","readings":[{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18286","senseId":"1","lemma":"과자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과자","audio":"/audio/8cbae77b051c729ee93f.mp3"}},{"text":"비슷한데","meaning":"相似、像","explanation":"비슷하다：相似、像；-ㄴ데 在句末交代背景并引出疑问。","readings":[{"term":"비슷하다","audio":"/audio/9903f9b7bf915b821809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65864","senseId":"1","lemma":"비슷하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비슷한데","audio":"/audio/453d75e67255269d3aaf.mp3"}},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；-이 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이게","audio":"/audio/080ef3b94e3a9d861970.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐지?","meaning":"是什么呢","explanation":"뭐：什么；-지? 在这里表示说话人对眼前物品自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐지","audio":"/audio/502fff0eccc5844a3784.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子，形状","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"与某物相同或相似的模样。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"8cbae77b051c729e","term":"과자","zh":"饼干、点心","